OL,3,GNEWSA'I'd never leave Boro, no matter  
OL,4,Ahow rich I get'                        
OL,6,FMiddlesbrough has been ranked as the   
OL,7,Fhardest place to grow up in a recent   
OL,8,Freport from the Children's             
OL,9,FCommissioner. How does that feel for   
OL,10,Fthe young people who call the Teesside 
OL,11,Ftown their home?                       
OL,13,F"I like it here. I'd never leave here, 
OL,14,Fno matter how rich I get."             
OL,16,FThis is what Scott, who attends Linx   
OL,17,FYouth Project in Middlesbrough, tells  
OL,18,Fme on a visit there.                   
